<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .banner {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 100vh;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 40px 60px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-sizing: border-box;

      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35)),
        url('image2.jpg');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
    }

    .banner::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 30%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55) 100%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .glass-box {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 520px;
      width: 100%;
      color: #fff;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .glass-box h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 0 15px;
      color: #fff;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    }

    .glass-box p {
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #f1f1f1;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
    }

    .glass-box p strong {
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn {
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .banner {
        padding: 30px 20px;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .glass-box {
        max-width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .glass-box h1 {
        font-size: 1.6rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <section class="banner">
    <div class="glass-box">
      <h1>Cat</h1>
      <p>
        Cats are <strong>highly sensitive to scent, chemicals, sounds and vibrations that we're unable to detect</strong>. Cats deposit odours and chemical messages called <strong>pheromones</strong> from glands over their face and body, and in their faeces and urine, to <strong>communicate and define their territory</strong>. They are therefore <strong>specialised in detecting the odours and pheromones of other cats</strong>.
      </p>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Read More</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
